  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 8022892544
    m_Localized: Cracked Urn
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 12703735808
    m_Localized: Cast spells for without using any color but all bottles drain color
      slowly over time. Cast all spells twice as fast. When having the urn in your
      inventory all bottles that are at least filled halfway up with color are considered
      as fully filled bottles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6789064481223999612
  - m_Id: 127681343298637824
    m_Localized: 'Cast spells for free but all bottles drain slowly over time. Cast
      all spells twice as fast. All half filled bottles are considered full bottles. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 6789064481223999612
  - m_Id: 127681361598386176
    m_Localized: Looks like an old urn I once found when hiking in the forest. I
      never understood that it could be a useful tool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
